<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:16.400" end="00:00:21.500" style="s2">You greedy, selfish fool shall receive</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:25.400" style="s2">no mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:28.100" style="s2">Once I was kind, forgiving and hopeful,</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.400" end="00:00:31.700" style="s2">but you took everything from me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.100" end="00:00:33.400" style="s2">All that remains is rage, hatred [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.700" end="00:00:35.500" style="s2">and madness.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.400" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">And now I shall turn your kingdom into a</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.500" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">frozen grave.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:49.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SOUND THE BELL! LINA IS COMING!</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.530" end="00:01:24.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.792" end="00:02:19.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY KING,</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.592" end="00:02:19.992" style="s2">TERRIBLE news from the north.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.826" end="00:02:24.792" style="s2">[sighs] Queen Lena has destroyed your</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.792" end="00:02:26.892" style="s2">brother&#39;s kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.792" end="00:02:29.341" style="s2">His army has been defeated</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.892" end="00:02:31.361" style="s2">and his lands have fallen.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.341" end="00:02:31.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.392" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about my brother?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.992" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">Do you have any news of him?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.892" end="00:02:42.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t know, your majesty. His fate</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.892" end="00:02:44.392" style="s2">remains unknown.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.892" end="00:02:47.192" style="s2">And Queen Lena might come for our</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.392" end="00:02:47.192" style="s2">kingdom next.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:54.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena has gone mad.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.392" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">Her hatred for humans has consumed her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.192" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">This must end.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.192" end="00:03:06.192" style="s2">I need to speak with my son.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.392" end="00:03:06.192" style="s2">Where is Goma?</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.892" end="00:03:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a group of orcs terrorizing</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.592" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">people, but I&#39;m not sure about their</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.292" end="00:03:24.392" style="s2">location.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:24.392" style="s2">Let&#39;s head down and ask some locals.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.792" end="00:03:27.292" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.692" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">I see some people over there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">Let&#39;s go talk to them.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.394" end="00:04:17.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day, folks.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.894" end="00:04:17.694" style="s2">Where are you all headed?</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.294" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orcs have been coming into our town</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:24.594" style="s2">recently.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.294" end="00:04:27.294" style="s2">They loot our homes and take whatever</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.594" end="00:04:27.294" style="s2">they want.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.898" end="00:04:31.883" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.863" end="00:04:31.883" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.758" end="00:04:37.778" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.994" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">And they beat anyone who stands in their</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.694" end="00:04:52.594" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:54.794" style="s2">They have even started killing people.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.594" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">We can&#39;t live there anymore. We have no</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.794" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">choice but to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.594" end="00:05:01.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry you&#39;ve been forced to leave</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.094" end="00:05:03.594" style="s2">your homes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.894" end="00:05:04.994" style="s2">No one should have to live in fear like</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.594" end="00:05:06.994" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.994" end="00:05:09.694" style="s2">Do you have any idea where these orcs</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.994" end="00:05:09.694" style="s2">are coming from?</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.094" end="00:05:13.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They come from the mountains to the</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:13.994" style="s2">north.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:17.294" style="s2">That&#39;s where they live.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.194" end="00:05:24.094" style="s2">They come down to raid our town</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.394" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">and then return to the mountains.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:33.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mountains to the north.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.094" end="00:05:37.294" style="s2">I will find those orcs.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.194" end="00:05:45.594" style="s2">Hopefully, you and your people will be</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.194" end="00:05:45.594" style="s2">able to return home soon.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.529" end="00:06:05.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.995" end="00:07:10.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; General.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:13.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My queen.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.495" end="00:07:21.495" style="s2">My queen,</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.795" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">these humans are not worthy of your</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.495" end="00:07:26.895" style="s2">time. Let us return home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.695" end="00:07:27.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Return home?</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.895" end="00:07:29.695" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.995" end="00:07:31.595" style="s2">Home can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.695" end="00:07:33.495" style="s2">I&#39;ve started a war and I won&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.595" end="00:07:34.995" style="s2">until their crowns lay buried beneath</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.495" end="00:07:36.595" style="s2">the snow.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.995" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My queen,</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.595" end="00:07:40.795" style="s2">at least allow me to remain by your</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.295" end="00:07:43.495" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.795" end="00:07:43.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may stay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.995" end="00:07:48.895" style="s2">Do you see it, Beru?</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.195" end="00:07:51.795" style="s2">The neighboring kingdoms are gathering</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.895" end="00:07:55.095" style="s2">their forces to delay the inevitable.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.795" end="00:07:55.095" style="s2">Let&#39;s not make them wait.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you command, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.360" end="00:08:07.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.397" end="00:08:20.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May your death bring you the honor you</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.697" end="00:08:20.097" style="s2">deserve in life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.730" end="00:08:42.750" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.621" end="00:09:07.641" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.797" end="00:09:19.797" style="s2">Hello, gentlemen.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.297" end="00:09:21.341" style="s2">Don&#39;t waste your lives over a few gold</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.797" end="00:09:23.361" style="s2">coins.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.341" end="00:09:23.361" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.597" end="00:09:33.186" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.166" end="00:09:33.186" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.786" end="00:09:35.806" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.991" end="00:09:44.897" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.497" end="00:09:44.897" style="s2">Bye.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.097" end="00:10:03.697" style="s2">Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.497" end="00:10:14.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chakra.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.498" end="00:10:16.298" style="s2">His Majesty wishes to see you</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.698" end="00:10:18.098" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:19.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The King?</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.098" end="00:10:21.398" style="s2">Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.398" end="00:10:24.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty will explain everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.398" end="00:10:24.098" style="s2">Please follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.398" end="00:10:43.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chakra,</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.798" end="00:10:46.098" style="s2">I am glad you have returned.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.398" end="00:10:48.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You summoned me, your Majesty?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.098" end="00:10:48.698" style="s2">What&#39;s happened?</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.598" end="00:10:54.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen Lena is destroying kingdoms one</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.298" end="00:10:56.498" style="s2">after another.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.498" end="00:11:00.198" style="s2">My brother&#39;s kingdom has already fallen</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.498" end="00:11:04.098" style="s2">to her, and ours could be next.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.198" end="00:11:04.098" style="s2">We must decide how to respond.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.298" end="00:11:11.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to do, your Majesty?</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.498" end="00:11:12.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find your friend, Prince Goma, and bring</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.198" end="00:11:14.798" style="s2">him back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:16.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, your Majesty. I will find</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.798" end="00:11:16.998" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.698" end="00:11:39.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chakra, my friend,</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.798" end="00:11:41.598" style="s2">I am so glad to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.798" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good to see you too, Goma. How&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.598" end="00:11:45.998" style="s2">adventure going?</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.298" end="00:11:48.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not much. Just hunting some Orcs in this</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.998" end="00:11:48.398" style="s2">valley.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.998" end="00:11:55.498" style="s2">I see.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.598" end="00:11:58.798" style="s2">Well, your father has summoned you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.498" end="00:11:58.798" style="s2">There is trouble with Queen Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.198" end="00:12:04.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.998" end="00:12:04.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will tell you everything on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.199" end="00:12:33.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If what you say is true,</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.199" end="00:12:34.699" style="s2">then Queen Lena will definitely come for</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.099" end="00:12:36.999" style="s2">our kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.699" end="00:12:39.099" style="s2">And when she does, innocent people will</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.999" end="00:12:40.799" style="s2">suffer.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.099" end="00:12:42.399" style="s2">Why wait for her to bring war to our</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.799" end="00:12:43.999" style="s2">doorstep?</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.399" end="00:12:46.699" style="s2">Let&#39;s take the fight to her before she</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.999" end="00:12:46.699" style="s2">reaches us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.499" end="00:12:56.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:58.799" style="s2">And I have waited long enough. General,</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.599" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">start preparing our army.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.799" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you wish, my king.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.199" end="00:13:13.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before we go to war,</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.299" end="00:13:13.799" style="s2">there is someone I need to see.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.799" end="00:13:43.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, big guy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.309" end="00:13:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.999" end="00:13:50.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goma,</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.399" end="00:13:51.199" style="s2">you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.099" end="00:13:54.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.199" end="00:13:54.099" style="s2">And I need your help.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.499" end="00:14:00.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we fighting someone?</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.799" end="00:14:03.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, a mad queen and her dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.899" end="00:14:06.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a dragon?</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.499" end="00:14:06.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A very big one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.899" end="00:14:10.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I eat it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:11.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, but I don&#39;t know what it tastes</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.499" end="00:14:12.819" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.199" end="00:14:14.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least they look good.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.819" end="00:14:16.299" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.799" end="00:14:17.801" style="s2">A dragon?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.299" end="00:14:20.301" style="s2">LET&#39;S GO.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.801" end="00:14:20.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.500" end="00:14:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.601" end="00:15:32.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, the enemy army is on the move.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.801" end="00:15:34.101" style="s2">Shall I take care of them?</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.401" end="00:15:35.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead, Baru.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.101" end="00:15:38.801" style="s2">I will join you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.401" end="00:15:38.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you wish, my queen.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:51.001" style="s2">Something is coming.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.801" end="00:16:11.201" style="s2">May your death bring you the honor you</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.101" end="00:16:13.501" style="s2">deserve in life.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.201" end="00:16:16.801" style="s2">Somebody&#39;s behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.501" end="00:16:16.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SOMEBODY&#39;S BEHIND US.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.271" end="00:16:19.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.902" end="00:16:24.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I GUESS IT BEGINS NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.102" end="00:16:51.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s fast, but not faster than me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.531" end="00:17:19.551" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.426" end="00:17:25.446" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.977" end="00:17:33.102" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.102" end="00:17:35.702" style="s2">I am here, brother.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.102" end="00:17:35.702" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.387" end="00:17:46.407" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.602" end="00:18:00.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barry is already here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.802" end="00:18:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Die.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.263" end="00:19:08.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.123" end="00:19:16.143" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.103" end="00:19:25.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PROTECT THE KING!</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.598" end="00:19:48.203" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.303" end="00:19:48.203" style="s2">A DRAGON!</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.248" end="00:20:05.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.449" end="00:20:31.469" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.034" end="00:20:36.054" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.579" end="00:21:01.599" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.005" end="00:21:12.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE IS MY BROTHER?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.205" end="00:21:12.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will join him soon.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.119" end="00:21:46.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.205" end="00:22:08.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you doing this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.390" end="00:22:08.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.105" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You believe a crown makes you</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.505" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">untouchable.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.905" end="00:22:21.405" style="s2">You take whatever you desire,</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.505" end="00:22:23.205" style="s2">destroy whoever stands in your way,</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.405" end="00:22:25.905" style="s2">and convince yourself that the throne</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.205" end="00:22:26.506" style="s2">justifies everything.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.905" end="00:22:29.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I built this</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:32.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; kingdom with my own hands.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.106" end="00:22:35.006" style="s2">I fought for this crown, bled for it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.906" end="00:22:39.306" style="s2">And even if I fall today,</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.006" end="00:22:39.306" style="s2">no one can erase the king I was.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.006" end="00:22:47.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still blinded and consumed by your own</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.206" end="00:22:47.306" style="s2">corrupted pride.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.006" end="00:22:59.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mad woman.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:22:59.006" style="s2">YOU HAVE TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.107" end="00:24:29.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HMM.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.207" end="00:24:35.307" style="s2">HUH.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
